{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日お仕事終わりに写真を現像したので\nせっかくならと思い、\nブログを書き始めてみてます…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも書き始めても結局載せない事が多いので\n今日は勢いで書いて勢いで載せますね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メンバー多めなので　是非。\n最後までご覧ください~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobOiMiiI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobrpj57n.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobuzHJzC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mob78ARWM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobDtiJ4X.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Make or Break のMV撮影。\n松田さん天さん夏鈴さんと差し入れで\nいただいたアイスをたべました\n松田さんが嬉しそうに食べられていたので\n撮らせていただきました\n大園さんも優ちゃんも綺麗~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobrp8KRU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobtCkLlY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobwAFhBn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobayS6qa.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobh3owEF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "LA に行かせていただいた時の写真。\nしーさんが珍しくツインテールをしていて\n可愛かったので撮りました\n珍しい髪型をすると見せにきてくれます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobcDhErp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobsmPgoh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛い。\n小田倉麗奈さん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そいえばさっき連絡が来ていました\n嬉しい　後で返します。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は携帯以外で撮った写真を\nばーっと載せてみました\nどうですかね。\n喜んでいただけていたら嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またすぐ書きます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "村山美羽"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobeQLyEc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobDmbdJ2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🐈‍⬛"}], "source": "official"}